{"rows":[[[],"editorDemo",null,"::X",{}],[["editorDemo"],"snippets",null,"::X",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"python",null,"def greet(name):\n    \"\"\"Return a greeting.\"\"\"\n    return f\"Hello, {name}!\"\n\nprint(greet(\"Gramlot\"))\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"javascript",null,"function greet(name) {\n    return `Hello, ${name}!`;\n}\n\nconsole.log(greet(\"Gramlot\"));\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"typescript",null,"interface User {\n    name: string;\n    active: boolean;\n}\n\nconst user: User = {name: \"Gramlot\", active: true};\nconsole.log(`Hello, ${user.name}!`);\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"json",null,"{\n    \"project\": \"Gramlot\",\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"languages\": [\"Python\", \"JavaScript\"],\n    \"indentation\": 4\n}\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"html",null,"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head><title>Hello Gramlot</title></head>\n    <body>\n        <h1>Hello, Gramlot!</h1>\n        <p>A small HTML document.</p>\n    </body>\n</html>\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"css",null,".greeting {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    color: #3467ab;\n    padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.greeting:hover {\n    color: #7544aa;\n}\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"xml",null,"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<catalog>\n    <book id=\"guide\">\n        <title>Gramlot guide</title>\n        <available>true</available>\n    </book>\n</catalog>\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"markdown",null,"# Hello, Gramlot!\n\nAn editor for **code** and *documents*.\n\n- Live Data binding\n- Configurable indentation\n- Search and replace\n\n```python\nprint(\"Hello!\")\n```\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"sql",null,"SELECT name, COUNT(*) AS total\nFROM documents\nWHERE status = 'published'\nGROUP BY name\nORDER BY total DESC;\n",{}],[["editorDemo","snippets"],"text",null,"Hello, Gramlot!\n\nThis is plain text.\nNo programming-language highlighting is applied.\n",{}],[["editorDemo"],"document",null,"::X",{}],[["editorDemo","document"],"source",null,"def greet(name):\n    \"\"\"Return a greeting.\"\"\"\n    return f\"Hello, {name}!\"\n\nprint(greet(\"Gramlot\"))\n",{}],[["editorDemo","document"],"saved",null,"",{}]]}::X